   "whatsnew": "<h3>RubyMine 2026.2.3 Is Out!</h3>\n<p>Fixes and improvements:</p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fixed Go to Declaration, inspections, and annotators for Ruby constants in Slim templates: <a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RUBY-36013\">RUBY-36013</a></li>\n <li>Fixed an issue where Rails tests run via Rake configurations failed on Windows: <a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RUBY-35940\">RUBY-35940</a></li>\n <li>Fixed an issue that prevented running RSpec tests with Ruby 4.x interpreters in WSL: <a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RUBY-36055\">RUBY-36055</a></li>\n <li>Fixed data loss when canceling merge conflict resolution: <a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/IJPL-251324\">IJPL-251324</a></li>\n <li>Fixed an IDE freeze caused by write actions waiting indefinitely for background tasks: <a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/IJPL-253271\">IJPL-253271</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>For the full list of closed issues, refer to the <a href=\"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/articles/RUBY-A-220365385/RubyMine-2026.2.3-262.10968.66-build-Release-Notes\">release notes</a>.</p>",
